      "writtenOn": "2023-01-19T15:25:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not directly related to this CL: I don\u0027t think we document that this scratch space exists. Should we?\nIs it useful for apps to use directly, or more for the developer when debugging etc?\n(E.g. we have functions in the payload API to return where things are mounted in the file system, but this isn\u0027t included: cs/android-internal/packages/modules/Virtualization/vm_payload/include/vm_payload.h?rcl\u003d6979b5fc0f902174241e989a863ee3b47dddc124\u0026l\u003d100)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 101,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 101,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "c890d4e4f18a01ea51c00fb47f7e691a3b75000a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
